      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Bondi Solar Energy were extremely professional from start to finish.  From the moment they came out to quote to the installation, nothing was a problem.  When they quoted they checked a few of our electricity bills to see the what our usage was.  This way they were able to advise just how many solar panels we would require.On the day of installation the Bondi Solar Energy Team turned up on time and got to work. Once the installation was complete they made sure all was working before leaving.  We received a phone call the next day to walk us through the Enlighten App and explain how it works and to show us the savings we had already made.We were initially worried about the street appeal and how the panels would look, now installed it is clear we had nothing to worry about as these are some sexy looking panels.  The other good thing is seeing just how much energy we are producing, being able to check it with the Enlighten App.Thank you Bondi Solar Energy for making this process so easy for us.  It is always a bit stressful when you are outlaying money and not knowing if your investment will work.  Now we look forward to receiving our energy bills.Harry and Inga",
